Applies to:

  paper3_fed_load/bdg2_federated_out/clients/*.parquet
  paper3_fed_load/bdg2_federated_out/manifest.json
  paper3_fed_load/bdg2_profile_out/*

Those files are an adaptation of the Building Data Genome Project 2
(BDG2), released by the Building and Urban Data Science (BUDS) Lab
under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 license:

  https://github.com/buds-lab/building-data-genome-project-2
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3887306

Changes made to the original: 60 buildings were selected from the
electricity meter table, joined with the weather and metadata tables,
resampled to hourly resolution with calendar features added, and split
per building into train, validation, calibration and test partitions.
No meter readings were altered.

The ShareAlike term carries over. Redistribution of these files, or of
anything derived from them, must be under CC BY-SA 4.0 or a compatible
license, must credit BDG2, and must state that changes were made. Full
license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

The MIT grant in section 1 does not extend to these files.
